.key DIR
.def DIR "DH1:speech"
; Speech-Setup: use amiga_speech from <DIR> until the next reboot.
; Nothing is written to disk: assigns, the shell path and ENV: only.
Assign SPEECH: "<DIR>"
Assign LIBS: SPEECH: ADD
Assign DEVS: SPEECH: ADD
Path SPEECH: ADD
SetEnv Narrator/DataDir SPEECH:
UnSetEnv Narrator/Capture
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
Echo "Speech is ready. Try:  Say Hello, I am your Amiga."
